    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive with empty pockets and high hopes in a city fueled by chance. Start with a few chips and a burning will to win. Play blackjack, craps, and roulette to build your fortune and rewrite your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752530/extras/7ed6a6a12450e82b3c49fb7a136d5079.avif?t=1752371044\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your favorite real-world casino games in <i>All In</i>. Enjoy authentic blackjack, craps, roulette, and slots with realistic rules and mechanics. Whether you\u2019re testing your skills or chasing jackpots, experience the thrill of the casino floor from the comfort of your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752530/extras/6d8cd64c67c5a43cb380a595d24eb917.avif?t=1752371044\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the ranks  to unlock new features, customizations, and  upgrades. Build your fortune and gain access to exclusive vehicles, stylish homes, and wacky unique casino perks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your way up the ladder as you bet smarter and win bigger \u2014 the city\u2019s luxuries are yours to claim. Customize your experience and show off your success in a world that rewards risk and skill.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive with empty pockets and high hopes in a city fueled by chance. Start with a few chips and a burning will to win. Play blackjack, craps, and roulette to build your fortune and rewrite your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752530/extras/7ed6a6a12450e82b3c49fb7a136d5079.avif?t=1752371044\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your favorite real-world casino games in <i>All In</i>. Enjoy authentic blackjack, craps, roulette, and slots with realistic rules and mechanics. Whether you\u2019re testing your skills or chasing jackpots, experience the thrill of the casino floor from the comfort of your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752530/extras/6d8cd64c67c5a43cb380a595d24eb917.avif?t=1752371044\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the ranks  to unlock new features, customizations, and  upgrades. Build your fortune and gain access to exclusive vehicles, stylish homes, and wacky unique casino perks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your way up the ladder as you bet smarter and win bigger \u2014 the city\u2019s luxuries are yours to claim. Customize your experience and show off your success in a world that rewards risk and skill.</p>",
    "short_description": "Nine to five isn\u2019t a life \u2014 it\u2019s a sentence. Start with a few chips and a burning drive to escape the grind. Take your shot at blackjack, roll the dice at craps, play the roulette wheel, and chase jackpots. The city runs on risk, and every gamble could be your last. Are you ready to go All In?",
